<section class="architecture-workflow" id="architecture-workflow" aria-labelledby="architecture-title">
<header><p class="eyebrow">01 / PLATFORM ARCHITECTURE</p><h3 id="architecture-title">From curriculum to learning evidence.</h3></header>
  <div class="full-workflow" id="full-workflow">
    <div class="flow-stage"><span class="stage-tag">CURRICULUM INPUT</span><h4>Curriculum Sources</h4><p>Bluebonnet mathematics curriculum · TEKS · Lead4ward · STAAR released-item metadata</p></div>
    <p class="edge">↓ <span>Teacher-reviewed structured extraction · current focus: ratios</span></p>
    <div class="flow-stage"><span class="stage-tag">STRUCTURED LEARNING TARGET</span><h4>Micro-skill Record</h4><p>Observable learning target + success criteria + prerequisites + common error signals</p></div>
    <p class="edge" aria-hidden="true">↓</p>
    <div class="branch-grid resources"><article><h5>Vocabulary</h5><p>Canonical terms, definitions, and language-access checks</p></article><article><h5>Misconceptions</h5><p>Approved candidate error patterns and confirmation checks</p></article><article><h5>Hint / Scaffold</h5><p>Graded support moves linked to evidence</p></article><article><h5>Visual</h5><p>Approved representation + visual_id + parameters</p></article></div>
    <p class="edge" aria-hidden="true">↓</p>
    <div class="flow-stage runtime"><span class="stage-tag">STUDENT INTERACTION</span><h4>Runtime Student Turn</h4><p>Student response + validator output + explanation + language and support context</p></div>
    <p class="edge" aria-hidden="true">↓</p>
    <div class="diagnosis-stage"><span class="stage-tag">ADAPTIVE DIAGNOSIS</span><h4>Adaptive Diagnosis</h4><ol class="diagnosis-chain"><li>Evidence<br /><strong>Collection</strong></li><li>Difficulty<br /><strong>Hypothesis</strong></li><li>Probe<br /><strong>Selection</strong></li><li>Diagnosis<br /><strong>Update</strong></li></ol></div>
    <p class="edge">↓ <span>Select the approved next move for this skill and evidence</span></p>
    <div class="branch-grid supports"><article><h5>Vocabulary support</h5><p>Rephrase, define a term, or offer bilingual access</p></article><article><h5>Concept probe</h5><p>Check relationship, quantity, order, or unit meaning</p></article><article><h5>Prerequisite probe</h5><p>Use an approved diagnostic for an earlier skill</p></article><article><h5>Visual support</h5><p>Use an approved representation—not a freely invented diagram</p></article></div>
    <p class="edge" aria-hidden="true">↓</p>
    <div class="flow-stage evidence"><span class="stage-tag">EVIDENCE &amp; FEEDBACK</span><h4>New Student Evidence</h4><p>Independent / supported / transfer evidence · support level used · confirmed or unconfirmed misconception</p></div>
    <p class="edge" aria-hidden="true">↓</p>
    <div class="flow-stage reporting"><h4>Teacher / Parent Views</h4><p>Target micro-skill · evidence trail · support used · misconception status · next instructional action</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

